    </div>

    <h1>
      <span class="line">Uganda's Next</span>
      <span class="line blue">Generation</span>
      <span class="line">of Innovators</span>
    </h1>

    <div class="hero-bottom">
      <p class="hero-desc">
        A free program for Ugandan secondary school students to build real digital skills, create impactful projects, and connect with mentors who care.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-btns">
        <a href="/register" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Join the Program →</a>
        <a href="#about" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">Learn More</a>
