    <span>Scroll</span>
    <div class="scroll-line"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="about">
  <div class="section-header section-header-row">
    <div>
      <span class="section-label">01 / What We Do</span>
      <h2>Empowering Youth.<br /><span class="blue">Building Futures.</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="section-desc">Hands-on workshops, mentorship, and real-world projects designed to equip Ugandan secondary school students with digital skills and innovation mindsets.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="cards cards-3">
    <div class="card">
      <span class="card-number">01</span>
      <span class="card-icon">💡</span>
      <h3>Innovation Workshops</h3>
      <p>Hands-on sessions in tech, entrepreneurship, and creative problem-solving for secondary school students across Uganda.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="card-number">02</span>
      <span class="card-icon">🌐</span>
      <h3>Digital Skills</h3>
      <p>Web development, graphic design, SEO, and digital marketing — practical skills that open real career pathways.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="card-number">03</span>
      <span class="card-icon">🤝</span>
      <h3>Mentorship</h3>
      <p>Direct access to Alffy's in-house team of designers, developers, and strategists who guide every project.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="border-top:1px solid var(--border)">
  <div class="section-header section-header-row">
    <div>
