      <h2>No Barriers.<br /><span class="blue">Just Opportunity.</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="section-desc">Government, private, or community — if you're a secondary school student in Uganda, you're welcome. No fees. No prerequisites. Just passion.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="cards cards-2">
    <div class="card">
      <span class="card-number">01</span>
      <h3>Any Ugandan School</h3>
      <p>From Kampala to Kabale, we welcome students from every district. All that matters is your willingness to learn and create.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="card-number">02</span>
      <h3>Any Interest Area</h3>
      <p>Tech, agriculture, arts, energy, health, or social impact — we match your passion to real projects and experienced mentors.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="cta-box">
    <p>Ready to begin your innovation journey?</p>
    <a href="/register" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Register Your Spot →</a>
  </div>
</section>

